    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent pizzas and donuts! Super friendly and fast service—the pizzas were ready in just five minutes! The donuts were delicious with generous portions, and the fries were perfectly crispy. An excellent experience with the perfect meal and desserts! Will be back often!",
        "time": 1740940801,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lino Sapienza",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111383432837577326937/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUlB7xrfWNo914o4Vmt0TSY2ZaeHpDYB-wz_9Ali-wJD7Sludc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Didn’t give a review the first time I went, my wife and I had a Margarita and Pepperoni pizza. Wasn’t sure how I felt about the taste. So I decided to go back with friends and ordered different pizzas to compare them to my first experience. And yes I enjoyed both experiences both with the food and most of all, the employees. What amazing personnel they have working there. They welcome you with a smile and are ready to serve you right away, with a smile. That’s why, I’ll go back again. So why the 4 star, I gauge by the Margarita pizza, wrong cheese, change the cheese and you get a 5 star, true pizzaiolos will know what I mean. I recommend taking your friends for a pizza that won’t break the bank.",
        "time": 1744851800,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natasha A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101433544138371552715/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-Ti6LyoJ_fMqY5EmZju6ZP21_Pw_oHlV82Rq-6rFmETN7-sw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Delicious, quick and budget friendly. Was so fresh ! Loved it",
        "time": 1766982081,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shak Afghanzadah",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110463207544928688415/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUOK-wCLvhLog79y_E92phQlGOVPVdbh7lgtoSsDNYH04euMMEE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We ordered the Picante and the Bros pizzas. Both were ready really fast and very delicious! I’ve tried their pizzas at their different locations and I have to say it’s always amazing every single time! P.s try out their chicken strips and fries!! The fries are seasoned and crispy!",
        "time": 1696988208,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dorin Popa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112463725811134094740/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2zE24O5rFhdni1-5Nhe5rEVExchDobppL_LYYca05MVzPuP4Tcw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Really nice concept of build your own personal sized pizza. The pizzas were delicious and the service quick and friendly. The restaurant is beautiful inside.",
